return ['domain'=>'zinn-offload','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'uz_UZ','project-id-version'=>'zinn-offload','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-02T10:28:39+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-02T10:28:39+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Media Offload'=>'Zinn® Media Offload','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload','Moves this site\'s media library to Zinn® object storage and serves it from a CDN. Configured from your Zinn® dashboard — no access key is ever typed into WordPress.'=>'Ushbu saytning media kutubxonasini Zinn® obyekt xotirasiga koʻchiradi va uni CDN orqali uzatadi. Zinn® boshqaruv panelingizdan sozlanadi — WordPress ichiga hech qachon kirish kaliti kiritilmaydi.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Saqlandi. Uni almashtirish uchun yangi qiymat kiriting.','Filter this list…'=>'Ushbu roʻyxatni filtrlash…','Filter this list'=>'Ushbu roʻyxatni saralash','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Ushbu filtrga hech narsa mos kelmadi.','Add a row'=>'Qator qoʻshish','Remove this row'=>'Bu qatorni olib tashlang','Remove'=>'Olib tashlash','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — umumiy ko‘rinish','Overview'=>'Umumiy koʻrinish','Copied'=>'Nusxalandi','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Ushbu saytdagi har bir Zinn® plagini va uning ishlayotganligi.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Ushbu plagin uchun hech qanday ulanish talab qilinmaydi.','Open settings'=>'Sozlamalarni ochish','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ushbu sozlamalarni oʻzgartirish uchun sizda ruxsat yoʻq.','Settings sections'=>'Sozlamalar boʻlimlari','Support'=>'Qoʻllab-quvvatlash','Save changes'=>'Oʻzgarishlarni saqlash','Tools'=>'Asboblar','Export settings'=>'Sozlamalarni eksport qilish','Reset to defaults'=>'Birlamchi holatga qaytarish','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Bu ushbu plaginning barcha sozlamalarini standart holatiga qaytaradi. Davom etasizmi?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Qo‘llab-quvvatlash uchun diagnostika','Import a settings file'=>'Sozlamalar faylini import qilish','Import'=>'Import qilish','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Eksport qilingan fayllarda hech qachon parollar, tokenlar yoki API kalitlari bo‘lmaydi — ularni yangi saytda qayta kiritishingiz kerak bo‘ladi.','Settings saved.'=>'Sozlamalar saqlandi.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Ushbu plaginning barcha sozlamalari standart holatiga qaytarildi.','Done.'=>'Bajarildi.','That action is not available.'=>'Bu amal mavjud emas.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Ushbu faylni oʻqib boʻlmadi. Zinn® plaginidan eksport qilingan sozlamalar faylini tanlang.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Ushbu fayl sozlamalar eksporti boʻlish uchun juda katta.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Ushbu fayl Zinn® sozlamalari eksporti emas.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Ushbu fayl boshqa plagin (%s)dan eksport qilingan, shuning uchun uni bu yerga import qilish ushbu plagin tushunmaydigan sozlamalarni saqlab qoʻyadi.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'%d ta sozlama import qilindi. Parollar va API kalitlari hech qachon eksportga kiritilmaydi, shuning uchun ularni qayta kiriting.' . "\0" . '%d ta sozlama import qilindi. Parollar va API kalitlari hech qachon eksportga kiritilmaydi, shuning uchun ularni qayta kiriting.','Zinn Digital® did not return a token. Nothing has been changed on this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® tokenni qaytarmadi. Ushbu saytda hech narsa oʻzgartirilmadi.','This site is no longer connected to Zinn® media offload. New uploads will stay on this server. Pair it again from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Bu sayt endi Zinn® media yukini kamaytirish tizimiga ulanmagan. Yangi yuklanmalar ushbu serverda qoladi. Uni Zinn Digital® boshqaruv panelingizdan qayta ulang.','Zinn Digital® answered with HTTP %d.'=>'Zinn Digital® HTTP %d bilan javob berdi.','Disconnected by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Zinn Digital® tomonidan uzildi.','Connected'=>'Ulandi','Connecting…'=>'Ulanmoqda…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Ulandi, biroq eʼtibor talab qiladigan masala bor','Not connected'=>'Ulanmagan','Running on your own account'=>'Oʻzingizning hisobingizda ishlayapti','We could not check this'=>'Buni tekshira olmadik','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Ushbu plagin sababini koʻrsatmadi. Diagnostika hisobotini yuboring va biz koʻrib chiqamiz.','Connection status'=>'Ulanish holati','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Oxirgi tekshiruv: %s oldin.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yangi varaqda ochiladi)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Buni Zinn® yordam xizmatiga yuboring','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Aynan mana shu yuboriladi — boshqa hech narsa yoʻq va yashirin hech narsa yoʻq. Parollaringiz, tokenlaringiz va API kalitlaringiz bu yerda mavjud emas.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Yuboriladigan diagnostika hisoboti','Copy to clipboard'=>'Vaqtinchalik xotiraga nusxalash','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Ushbu hisobotni Zinn® yordam xizmatiga yuboring','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Siz uchun qoʻllab-quvvatlash chiptasini ochamiz va elektron pochta orqali javob beramiz. Agar uni yubormoqchi boʻlmasangiz, yuqoridagi matndan nusxa oling va uni chiptaga oʻzingiz joylashtiring.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Ushbu serverdan (%s) Zinn Digital® bilan bog‘lanib bo‘lmadi. Yuqoridagi hisobotdan nusxa oling va buning o‘rniga chipta oching — sozlamalaringizda hech qanday xatolik yo‘q.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Yuborildi. Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati hisobotingizni qabul qildi va elektron pochta orqali javob beradi.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Yuborildi. Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati hisobotingizni qabul qildi — havola %s — va elektron pochta orqali javob beradi.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Qisqa vaqt ichida bir nechta hisobot yubordingiz. Bir necha daqiqa kuting va qayta urinib koʻring — avvalgilari yetib borgan.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® hozirgina hisobotni qabul qila olmadi — bu muammo siz tomonda emas, biz tomonda. Birozdan soʻng qayta urinib koʻring yoki yuqoridagi hisobotni chiptaga nusxalang.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Hisobot rad etildi (HTTP %d). Uni yuqoridan nusxalang va ushbu raqamni koʻrsatib, murojaat oching.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — qoʻllanmalar va xizmatlar','User guides'=>'Foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmalari','Read the %s user guide'=>'%s foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmasini oʻqing','Hide this'=>'Buni yashirish','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'WordPress uchun Zinn® xostingi','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, har kungi zaxira nusxalari, bepul koʻchirish va birdan ortiq saytni boshqaradigan kishilar uchun yaratilgan boshqaruv paneli.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® bozori','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Har ikki tomon rozi bo‘lguniga qadar mablag‘lar xavfsiz saqlangan holda mavjud saytlar, domenlar va havola joylashtirishlarini xarid qiling hamda soting.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — buni kasb qilgan mutaxassislarni yollang','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Bizning global frilans bozorimiz: yozuvchilar, dizaynerlar, dasturchilar va SEO mutaxassislarining 10 000 dan ortiq tayyor xizmatlarini koʻrib chiqing yoki loyiha joylashtirib, ularga taklif kiritish imkonini bering.','Media Offload'=>'Mediani tashqi serverga yuklash','Connection'=>'Ulanish','What gets moved'=>'Nimalar koʻchiriladi','How media is served'=>'Media qanday taqdim etilishi','Move a batch now'=>'To‘plamni hozir ko‘chiring','Media already moved is never affected by a change here — its address does not change.'=>'Allaqachon koʻchirilgan medialarga bu yerdagi oʻzgarish hech qachon taʼsir qilmaydi — ularning manzili oʻzgarmaydi.','New uploads'=>'Yangi yuklanmalar','Move new uploads to Zinn® storage as they arrive'=>'Yangi yuklanmalarni kelishi bilan Zinn® xotirasiga oʻtkazing','Existing media'=>'Mavjud media','Keep moving the media library that is already here'=>'Allaqachon shu yerda boʻlgan media kutubxonasini koʻchirishda davom eting','A few files an hour, in the background, picking up where it left off. Turning this off pauses it; nothing already moved comes back.'=>'Orqa fonda, toʻxtagan joyidan davom etgan holda soatiga bir nechta fayl. Buni oʻchirish jarayonni toʻxtatib turadi; koʻchirilgan narsalarning hech biri qaytarilmaydi.','Files per hourly pass'=>'Har soatlik oʻtishdagi fayllar','Each attachment is several files and every one is a full upload. Raise this on a fast host with a generous execution limit; lower it if passes are being cut short.'=>'Har bir birikma bir nechta fayldan iborat boʻlib, ularning har biri toʻliq yuklanishdir. Buni katta ijro limiti mavjud boʻlgan tezkor xostda oshiring; agar oʻtishlar erta toʻxtatib qoʻyilayotgan boʻlsa, uni kamaytiring.','Leave files smaller than'=>'Bundan kichik fayllarni qoldiring','Kilobytes. A tiny icon costs more in the extra connection than it saves in disk, so there is rarely a reason to move one. Set to 0 to move everything.'=>'Kilobaytlar. Kichik belgi diskda tejaganidan koʻra qoʻshimcha ulanishda koʻproq xarajat talab qiladi, shuning uchun uni koʻchirishdan deyarli hech qanday foyda yoʻq. Hammasini koʻchirish uchun 0 ga sozlang.','Never move these types'=>'Bu turlarni hech qachon koʻchirmang','Useful when a plugin reads a file straight off the disk — a font, a PDF a form builder stamps, an audio file a player seeks inside.'=>'Plagin faylni toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri diskdan oʻqiganda foydali — shrift, shakl yaratuvchisi tamgʻalaydigan PDF, pleyer ichida qidiradigan audio fayl.','These two are the ones to be careful with — read each description before changing it.'=>'Bu ikkalasi bilan ehtiyot boʻlish kerak — oʻzgartirishdan oldin har bir tavsifni oʻqib chiqing.','Serve from Zinn® storage'=>'Zinn® xotirasidan uzating','Point image and file addresses at Zinn® storage'=>'Rasm va fayl manzillarini Zinn® xotirasiga yoʻnaltiring','Off, files are uploaded but still served from this server — which is the safe state while you check everything arrived. On, visitors are served from storage and this server stops carrying the traffic.'=>'Oʻchiq, fayllar yuklangan, lekin hali ham ushbu serverdan uzatiladi — bu hamma narsa yetib kelganini tekshirguningizcha xavfsiz holatdir. Yoniq, tashrif buyuruvchilarga saqlash xizmatidan xizmat koʻrsatiladi va ushbu server trafikni qabul qilishni toʻxtatadi.','Free the disk space'=>'Disk maydonini boʻshating','Delete the local copy once every size has uploaded'=>'Har bir o‘lcham yuklangandan so‘ng mahalliy nusxani o‘chiring','This is the point of offloading, and it is also the irreversible half. Leave it off until “Serve from Zinn® storage” is on and you have checked your site — a local copy is the only thing that saves you if something was missed.'=>'Yukni yengillatishning asosiy maqsadi shu, shuningdek, bu jarayonning ortga qaytarib bo‘lmaydigan qismidir. “Serve from Zinn® storage” yoqilmaguncha va siz saytingizni tekshirib ko‘rmaguningizcha uni o‘chiq qoldiring — agar biror narsa o‘tkazib yuborilgan bo‘lsa, sizni qutqaradigan yagona narsa mahalliy nusxadir.','Deleting local copies cannot be undone from this screen. Take a backup first — the Zinn® Connector plugin can do that for you.'=>'Mahalliy nusxalarni oʻchirishni ushbu ekrandan bekor qilib boʻlmaydi. Avval zaxira nusxasini oling — Zinn® Connector plagini buni siz uchun bajarishi mumkin.','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage yet, so there is nowhere to move media to.'=>'Ushbu sayt hali Zinn® xotirasiga ulanmagan, shuning uchun medialarni koʻchirish uchun joy yoʻq.','%d attachment moved.'=>'%d ilova koʻchirildi.' . "\0" . '%d biriktirma ko‘chirildi.','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage.'=>'Ushbu sayt Zinn® xotirasiga ulanmagan.','Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Media stays on this server until it is.'=>'Hech qanday muammo yoʻq — u shunchaki hali ulanmagan. Media ulanmaguncha ushbu serverda qoladi.','Connected, but the last upload failed.'=>'Ulandi, lekin oxirgi yuklash amalga oshmadi.','Try a batch now'=>'Hozir toʻplamni sinab koʻring','Connected. Every attachment has been moved.'=>'Ulandi. Barcha birikmalar koʻchirildi.','Connected. %1$s of %2$s attachments still on this server.'=>'Ulandi. %2$s birikmadan %1$s tasi hali ham ushbu serverda.','Moved so far'=>'Hozirgacha koʻchirildi','%1$s files, %2$s'=>'%1$s ta fayl, %2$s','Still on this server'=>'Hali ham ushbu serverda','%1$s of %2$s attachments'=>'%2$s ta birikmadan %1$s tasi','Served from'=>'Qayerdan uzatiladi','this server'=>'ushbu server','Connect this site'=>'Ushbu saytni ulang','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, choose this site, open Files & databases, and press “Get a pairing code” under Images & video CDN. Paste the code below.'=>'Zinn Digital® boshqaruv panelingizni oching, ushbu saytni tanlang, Files & databases boʻlimini oching va Images & video CDN ostidagi “Get a pairing code” tugmasini bosing. Kodni quyiga joylashtiring.','Pairing code'=>'Ulanish kodi','Disconnect this site'=>'Ushbu saytni uzish','New uploads will stay on this server. Media already moved keeps working — its address does not change.'=>'Yangi yuklanmalar ushbu serverda qoladi. Koʻchirilgan media fayllar ishlashda davom etadi — ularning manzili oʻzgarmaydi.','You do not have permission to manage this site.'=>'Sizda ushbu saytni boshqarish uchun ruxsat yo‘q.','Paste the pairing code from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Zinn Digital® boshqaruv panelingizdagi juftlashtirish kodini joylashtiring.','Connected. New uploads will be stored with Zinn Digital® from now on, and your existing media will move in the background.'=>'Ulandi. Yangi yuklamalar bundan buyon Zinn Digital® xizmatida saqlanadi va mavjud medialaringiz orqa fonda koʻchiriladi.','Disconnected. Media already moved keeps working; new uploads stay on this server.'=>'Aloqa uzildi. Koʻchirilgan media fayllar ishlashda davom etadi; yangi yuklanmalar ushbu serverda qoladi.','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'Ushbu faylni bu serverdan oʻqib boʻlmadi, shuning uchun hech narsa yuklanmadi.','This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent.'=>'Bu sayt yuklashni oqimli uzata olmadi, shuning uchun hech narsa yuborilmadi.','This file is %1$s and this site\'s PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s.'=>'Ushbu fayl hajmi %1$s va ushbu saytning PHP-sida cURL yoʻq, shuning uchun yuklashi mumkin boʻlgan eng katta hajm %2$s.','The upload could not be completed.'=>'Yuklashni yakunlab bo‘lmadi.','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d).'=>'Xotira yuklashni rad etdi (HTTP %d).','Style preset'=>'Uslub andozasi','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Boshlangʻich nuqta. Quyidagi har qanday narsa uni bekor qiladi.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Oʻzimning ranglarim va oʻlchamlarimdan foydalaning','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Buni oʻchiq holda qoldiring va oldindan sozlangan parametr aynan qanday boʻlsa, shunday ishlatiladi.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Zinn Digital® reliz qaydlarini koʻring.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Zinn® yangilash xizmati ushbu yangilanish uchun yuklab olish havolasini taqdim etmadi. Ushbu sayt Zinn® platformasiga ulana olishini tekshiring, soʻng qayta urinib koʻring.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Yangilanishni Zinn® yangilash xizmatidan (%s) yuklab boʻlmadi. Bir necha daqiqadan soʻng qayta urinib koʻring.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Yuklab olingan yangilanish butunlik tekshiruvidan oʻtmadi va oʻrnatilmadi.']];